sequenceDiagram
  actor Manager
  actor Admin
  participant CondominiumsController
  participant CondominiumService

  Manager->>CondominiumsController: GET /api/platform/condominiums
  CondominiumsController->>CondominiumService: GetAllCondominiumsAsync()
  CondominiumService-->>CondominiumsController: condominium list
  CondominiumsController-->>Manager: 200 OK

  Manager->>CondominiumsController: POST /api/platform/condominiums
  CondominiumsController->>CondominiumService: CreateCondominiumAsync(request)
  CondominiumService-->>CondominiumsController: created condominium
  CondominiumsController-->>Manager: 201 Created

  Admin->>CondominiumsController: GET /api/platform/condominiums/{id}
  Note over CondominiumsController: Admin can access only own condominium.
  CondominiumsController->>CondominiumService: GetCondominiumByIdAsync(id)
  CondominiumService-->>CondominiumsController: condominium data
  CondominiumsController-->>Admin: 200 OK or 403

  Manager->>CondominiumsController: PUT /api/platform/condominiums/{id}
  CondominiumsController->>CondominiumService: UpdateCondominiumAsync(request)
  CondominiumService-->>CondominiumsController: updated condominium
  CondominiumsController-->>Manager: 200 OK

  Manager->>CondominiumsController: DELETE /api/platform/condominiums/{id}
  CondominiumsController->>CondominiumService: DeleteCondominiumAsync(id)
  CondominiumService-->>CondominiumsController: deleted flag
  CondominiumsController-->>Manager: 204 NoContent or 404
